+# Wire Format
+
+Nothing is recorded. This project's documentation and changelog contain no current decision designating a single wire serialisation format; the codebase instead offers multiple interchangeable renderers and binders (including JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, protobuf, and msgpack), with no recorded policy establishing one as the project's standard.
